# GitHub Actions

After a push or PR, check `gh run list` / `gh run view --log-failed`. If a workflow is red, fix it in the same session and land the fix through `develop` → `main`. Do not leave failing `test` or `release` jobs.

`make test` must include what CI runs: host unit, integration, Vitest, and `npm run check` (tsc). `make test` green locally is not enough if `npm run check` was skipped.

```bash
# ❌ BAD
# commit after make test while Actions tsc is red

# ✅ GOOD
# gh run view <id> --log-failed
# fix, make test, PR to develop, then develop → main
```
